    {
      "type": "ascii",
      "start": 1630,
      "end": 1979,
      "text": "The Hellion is popular among the Ice Hellions, appearing in nearly every light Star. In other Clans it is far less common, but appears periodically among the Toumans of all the Homeworld Clans. A surprising number have surfaced in the Clan OZ's, however, undoubtedly owing to the loss of an entire Hellion shipment from Hector to the Diamond Sharks."
